# Lines that MUST appear literally in Robot.PowerShell/.gitignore.
# Enforced by Test-GitignoreIntegrity (private/admin/test-gitignoreintegrity.ps1)
# at Start-RobotApi time. Comments and blank lines in THIS file are
# stripped at compare time, so feel free to annotate.
#
# Removing a line here without verifying every artifact it protected has
# moved elsewhere is a SECURITY error — the protective rule will silently
# stop being enforced.

# Protects the API response cache, Margonem PEM, audit log, and any
# future cache-located secret artifacts. Required by:
#   - Robot.MargonemPublicKeyCache (lib/MargonemPublicKeyCache.cs)
#   - Write-MargonemAuditLog (plugins/robot-api/private/margonem-audit.ps1)
#   - ApiResponseCache (lib/ApiResponseCache.cs)
**/.robot.local/.cache/
